      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金巨匠",
      "source_fingerprint": "2890107b21ce870cc8ff5653b89724712215b18ebf279831a6ff7fb65f740fbf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:066349c8dba47d4a19ff33b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金巨匠同学――真是厉害呀。\n尤其是在『皐月赏』的压倒性胜利令我心潮澎湃。",
